<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-24T02:26:43.535Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 02:26:43 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces have taken control of three checkpoints in Jurf al-Sakhar and reopened the Karbala road while Kataib Hezbollah begins a phased withdrawal from the area. The government and Egypt have agreed to scrap visa requirements and signed tax and cooperation deals, and the Iraqi prime minister is preparing a Cairo visit to deepen economic ties. Oil thefts have been reported across all governorates with estimated losses of $150 billion, and a gas pipeline fire at the Hartha power station near Basra killed at least four people and injured dozens. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOVm83T0VDbDczSmpYcE9WS3ZXZjZmSVdRWno3dEtHNzQ3ZzZjSDJaR0pJWkFxLXVhMEtvRkF3bFhyRDVPUWUzcjgtNUp2U3RhM0FvMHRGWl9GTUxHbWYydlJxeDRURGxpUzA0cWtMdGVtMl9XSzdUZDE5bTRSUHBnSUt0X0ZKZGEtdWhhUWs3c205RWdVR0J4UW1Zb253WTJPeGZDd3BIcXY1ZGtza0Nqd2RSeG5EM21PZFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Forbes Middle East&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;VOA - Voice of America English News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxNeEt6SUxINFM0ZUNacUtPLU1raU5ya0pKOVIzeEw2a2E5eUpOXzJuSXpjMlNHcERoWGdodXpUa2VtQ0wzVFFrN2Y3dkZxRTlUUmFpR0FBMnhoRDlEa1ZuSlFTc25QbUw0OW4wQlJYOWZoSThhSDdHTFZXT25IS0xaMnJpYzlwZGozX1AybUR2ck4tbTN0dTA4ckgwc3o4Y181VEliU1dhTFR6UmkzQ0dpV09Faw?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASHARQ AL-AWSAT English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;FDD's Long War Journal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPSThiYzdIbFdKaTdUWEptZzBfV3dXZE4zdU1PUVkya1UtQXNFdkRmWGV4REk5X0VwdkFBbW00V0Ridjl2SlF5S3IxV3VEdXBMdlNxTElPQkRaYW9jWW1FMmpyZUtCZEVLZjVQc29nVkVONHZLQTBObS1XLXRyVGxWTDd3MWZzNF